     A* Project:     Project #4 Part A - Customer Balance and Payment Report
     A* File:        FINREPORT.PRTF
     A* Programmer:  Chris Grimm
     A* Date:        09/28/2020
     A*
     A* Description:
     A*   External printer file definition for the Customer Balance and
     A*   Payment Report. Defines report headers, customer financing detail
     A*   rows with custom edit words, summary grand totals with floating
     A*   dollar signs, and total customer count.
     A*
     A* Used By:     PROJECT4A.RPGLE
     A*=========================================================================
     A          R HEADING
     A                                     5DATE(*SYS)
     A                                      EDTCDE(Y)
     A                                    53'CloudServices24x7, Inc.'
     A                                   118'Page'
     A                                   125PAGNBR
     A                                      SPACEA(1)
     A                                    48'Customer Balance and Payment Repor-
     A                                      t'
     A                                      SPACEA(1)
     A                                     5'Cust.'
     A                                    17'Purchase'
     A                                    30'Purchase'
     A                                    44'Down'
     A                                    57'Balance'
     A                                    73'Monthly'
     A                                     5'Num.'
     A                                      SPACEB(1)
     A                                    18'Amount'
     A                                    32'Date'
     A                                    43'Payment'
     A                                    59'Owed'
     A                                    73'Payment'
     A                                      SPACEA(1)
     A*-------------------------------------------------------------------------
     A          R DETAIL
     A                                      SPACEB(1)
     A                                    34'-'
     A            PURMON         2  0O    35EDTCDE(3)
     A            CUSTNO         6S 0O     5
     A            FINAMT         7S 2O    +6EDTWRD('    0.  ')
     A            PURDAY         2  0O    32EDTCDE(3)
     A            DWNPAY         7S 2O    42EDTWRD('  ,  0.  ')
     A            BALDUE         7S 2O    +6EDTWRD('  ,  0.  ')
     A            MONTHPAY       6  2O    +6EDTWRD(' ,  0.  ')
     A*-------------------------------------------------------------------------
     A          R TOTAL
     A                                  7 26'Totals'
     A                                  9  1'Number of customers processed'
     A            TOTALDOWN      8  2O  7 40EDTWRD('   ,  $0.  ')
     A            TOTALOWED      8  2O  7 55EDTWRD('   ,  $0.  ')
     A            TOTALPAY       8  2O  7 69EDTWRD('   ,  $0.  ')
     A            CUSTCOUNT      3  0O  9 31EDTWRD('  0')
